atar/6016/c49e/22864_xxxlarge.png?m=1790941623", "created": 1341093285, "last_modified": 1790941623, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Tory12138", "last_touched": 1790994107, "title": "爷青回！在浏览器里复刻了 CS/CF「运输船」联机版", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246157", "created": 1790942340, "deleted": 0, "content": "前几天看到有人开源单机版，被回忆袭击，就特别想做个联机版 CS, 于是做了这个游戏，重温当年的手感～\r\n\r\n阴人、爆头，开箱即战、秒进\r\n\r\n突突突，超解压，来开一局\r\n\r\nhttps://playcsbrowser.com/zh", "content_rendered": "前几天看到有人开源单机版，被回忆袭击，就特别想做个联机版 CS, 于是做了这个游戏，重温当年的手感～<br /><br />阴人、爆头，开箱即战、秒进<br /><br />突突突，超解压，来开一局<br /><br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://playcsbrowser.com/zh\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://playcsbrowser.com/zh</a>", "last_modified": 1790942340, "replies": 23, "id": 1246157}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_large.png?m=1660301119", "name": "create", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_normal.png?m=1660301119", "title": "分享创造", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/create", "topics": 37242, "footer": "", "header": "欢迎你在这里发布自己的最新作品！", "title_alternative": "Create", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_mini.png?m=1660301119", "stars": 6212, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 17, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 492816, "username": "abersheeran", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/abersheeran", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "我尊重明者与智者。", "bio": "我对谦和的人谦和，对理性的人理性，与狷狂的人一起狷狂，对自以为是的人会更加自以为是。", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2fa34ee02af742311f2cfdbd43ef917d?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2fa34ee02af742311f2cfdbd43ef917d?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2fa34ee02af742311f2cfdbd43ef917d?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1591093844, "last_modified": 1716946753, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Ariver", "last_touched": 1790975150, "title": "做了个网盘，同一份文件可以由一万个人分摊存储费", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246174", "created": 1790948533, "deleted": 0, "content": "做了一个网盘 Vorax Cloud ，核心功能是：同一份文件被多人保存时，只存一份，存储费由大家平摊。\r\n\r\n存一批 1TB 的文件，原本每月存储费是 $15 ，如果有一万个人保存，每个人分摊到的这批文件的存储费就是 $0.0015/月。\r\n另外也支持 WebDAV ，以及绑定自己的域名公开访问文件。\r\n\r\nhttps://voraxcloud.com\r\n\r\n底层存储用的 S3 ，手上有一些想和朋友一起共享资源的文件可以体验一下。到 https://www.producthunt.com/products/vorax-cloud?launch=vorax-cloud 可以领免费三个月的 geek 会员。希望大家能免费体验一下", "content_rendered": "<p>做了一个网盘 Vorax Cloud ，核心功能是：同一份文件被多人保存时，只存一份，存储费由大家平摊。</p>\n<p>存一批 1TB 的文件，原本每月存储费是 $15 ，如果有一万个人保存，每个人分摊到的这批文件的存储费就是 $0.0015/月。\n另外也支持 WebDAV ，以及绑定自己的域名公开访问文件。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://voraxcloud.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://voraxcloud.com</a></p>\n<p>底层存储用的 S3 ，手上有一些想和朋友一起共享资源的文件可以体验一下。到 <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/vorax-cloud?launch=vorax-cloud\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.producthunt.com/products/vorax-cloud?launch=vorax-cloud</a> 可以领免费三个月的 geek 会员。希望大家能免费体验一下</p>\n", "last_modified": 1790948533, "replies": 23, "id": 1246174}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 242015, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4526, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 660015, "username": "hijacker155", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/hijacker155", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1bb5ed372c7316850ef00338b5b5dcfd?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1bb5ed372c7316850ef00338b5b5dcfd?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1bb5ed372c7316850ef00338b5b5dcfd?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1699052630, "last_modified": 1770341661, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "eventlooped", "last_touched": 1790996435, "title": "大佬们，如果让你们推荐一本此生必读的书，你们会推荐哪一本？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246209", "created": 1790990878, "deleted": 0, "content": "随便什么类型的书都可以，没有限制", "content_rendered": "<p>随便什么类型的书都可以，没有限制</p>\n", "last_modified": 1790990878, "replies": 18, "id": 1246209}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 242015, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4526, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 315301, "username": "jimmycmh", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/jimmycmh", "website": "TrueSOTA 官网：https://true-sota.com/?from=v2ex", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4cae27dbac80a2a163550c4c545510cd?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4cae27dbac80a2a163550c4c545510cd?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4cae27dbac80a2a163550c4c545510cd?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1525853093, "last_modified": 1525853093, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "chunqiuyiyu", "last_touched": 1790964217, "title": "个人项目做到哪种程度你才愿意发出来给别人用呢？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246170", "created": 1790947621, "deleted": 0, "content": "假期想做点小东西，但是感觉个人项目最容易卡在再改一点就能发了这个程度。\r\n\r\n功能已经能用了但是又觉得界面不太行，界面改完了又发现还没写说明，整到最后越做越像正式产品，反而一直没机会知道有没有人需要。\r\n\r\n所以想问问做过个人项目的朋友，你第一次公开的时候东西是完成到什么程度？\r\n\r\n会先丢给几个朋友试试还是还是直接发，边被吐槽边改？", "content_rendered": "<p>假期想做点小东西，但是感觉个人项目最容易卡在再改一点就能发了这个程度。</p>\n<p>功能已经能用了但是又觉得界面不太行，界面改完了又发现还没写说明，整到最后越做越像正式产品，反而一直没机会知道有没有人需要。</p>\n<p>所以想问问做过个人项目的朋友，你第一次公开的时候东西是完成到什么程度？</p>\n<p>会先丢给几个朋友试试还是还是直接发，边被吐槽边改？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1790947621, "replies": 17, "id": 1246170}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 73682, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9792, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 448498, "username": "iJamesChan", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/iJamesChan", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5fbd68f369a7d3b4817d59c51f9f9c71?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5fbd68f369a7d3b4817d59c51f9f9c71?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5fbd68f369a7d3b4817d59c51f9f9c71?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1571753805, "last_modified": 1790943092, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "OneLiteCore", "last_touched": 1790964307, "title": "做了个真匿名的树洞", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246158", "created": 1790943224, "deleted": 0, "content": "想做个真正的匿名树洞应该好多年了，域名都注册十多年了，现在开发容易多了\r\nhttps://siyuzhe.com\r\n刚做好，没内容，都是乱七八糟的测试主题和留言", "content_rendered": "想做个真正的匿名树洞应该好多年了，域名都注册十多年了，现在开发容易多了<br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://siyuzhe.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://siyuzhe.com</a><br />刚做好，没内容，都是乱七八糟的测试主题和留言", "last_modified": 1790943224, "replies": 15, "id": 1246158}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal"